      "title": "btatt: Account for the ATT bearer when tracking ATT transactions.",
      "message": "btatt: Account for the ATT bearer when tracking ATT transactions.\n\nThis uses the bearer's L2CAP CID as an additional cache key to\nensure transactions are tracked correctly on each bearer.\n\nThis applies to requests/responses, indications/confirmations,\nand the reassembly of PDU fragments.\n",
      "author_name": "Brian Ejike",
      "author_email": "bcejike@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-06-02T03:12:08.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2025-06-08T11:55:41.000+02:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/227cfd267bfcc493f6cbfb1a42bdc21c616fdff0"
    },
    {
